      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "完成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag or scroll to move the frame · pinch to resize · Return to keep · Esc to cancel": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拖动或滚动移动取景框 · 捏合改大小 · 回车保留 · Esc 取消"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each website can live on its own screen; “Main Display” is whichever one has the menu bar, so it moves when you rearrange displays or dock your laptop.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个网站可以待在自己的屏幕上；「主显示器」指当前显示菜单栏的那一块，重排显示器或接扩展坞时会跟着换。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edit": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "编辑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edit…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "编辑…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enable": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enabled State": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用状态"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Error: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "出错：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every website you are signed in to will be signed out, and your websites and their settings are kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有已登录的网站都会被登出，你的网站和它们的设置会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fades the wallpaper back while you work elsewhere, and brings it up again when you click the desktop.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你在别处工作时让壁纸淡下去，点桌面时再亮回来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Feedback Welcome": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "欢迎反馈"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For websites that do not set their own; one that does, in its own settings, ignores this.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "供没有自己设定的网站使用；在自己设置里设了节奏的网站不受这里影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Force browsing mode to the front": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "浏览模式时强制最前"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Forces the website's print styles (“@media print”) if it has any, which are often simpler.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "强制使用网站的打印样式（「@media print」），如果有的话——它通常更简洁。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Freed %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已释放 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "From": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "General": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
