        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "获取启用状态"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Get Started with Nifro": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开始使用 Nifro"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Get the current enabled state of Nifro": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "获取 Nifro 当前的启用状态"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GitHub": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GitHub 仓库"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hide menu bar icon": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隐藏菜单栏图标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold to use the page": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按住以操作网页"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How often a page goes stale is a property of the page; off follows the interval in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一个页面多久过时是页面自己的性质；关闭则跟随「设置」里的间隔。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How see-through the wallpaper is against the desktop behind it; Browsing Mode always draws it fully opaque.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "壁纸相对于背后桌面的透明程度；浏览模式下始终完全不透明。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you cannot see the website, hide some windows to reveal the desktop.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果看不到网站，收起一些窗口把桌面露出来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Incorrect directory.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目录不对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inject your own CSS or JavaScript into this website. Most websites need neither.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "给这个网站注入你自己的 CSS 或 JavaScript。绝大多数网站两个都不需要。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inspired by [Plash](https://github.com/sindresorhus/Plash) by Sindre Sorhus.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "灵感来自 Sindre Sorhus 的 [Plash](https://github.com/sindresorhus/Plash)。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Invalid URL for the “add” command.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「add」命令的网址无效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Invert colors": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "反转颜色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inverts every colour on the website, as a fake dark mode for sites that have none.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "反转网站的全部颜色，给没有深色模式的网站做一个假的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Is Current": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "是当前网站"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Is Enabled": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已启用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its custom CSS, JavaScript, region and schedule go with it, you will be signed out of the site, and there is no undo.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为它写的自定义 CSS、JavaScript、缩放区域和排期会一起消失，你会从这个网站退出登录，而且无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JavaScript": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JavaScript"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保留"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep changes?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保留更改吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep the website above all other windows while browsing mode is active.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "浏览模式期间让网站保持在所有窗口之上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Language": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "语言"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Later": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "稍后"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Launch Nifro again to bring the menu bar icon back for 5 seconds.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "再次启动 Nifro，菜单栏图标会回来 5 秒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Launch at login": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登录时启动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets you temporarily interact with the website, to log in or scroll to a particular place.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "让你临时操作网站，比如登录，或者滚到某个位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets you use the page without Browsing Mode, at the cost of your desktop icons sitting behind the window and the page having to keep rendering.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不用切到浏览模式就能操作网页，代价是桌面图标被挡在窗口后面，而且网页必须一直渲染。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Loads the page even though macOS does not trust its certificate — normal for a device on your own network, unsafe for anything from the public internet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "即使 macOS 不信任它的证书也照样加载——自己网络里的设备很正常，公网上的页面则不安全。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Local Website…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本地网页…"
          }
        }
