    },
    "Switches Nifro to a random website in the list.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "切换到列表里的随机一个网站。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switches Nifro to the next website in the list.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "切换到列表里的下一个网站。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switches Nifro to the previous website in the list.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "切换到列表里的上一个网站。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The address of the player on its own, so the video fills the wallpaper without the navigation, recommendations and comments around it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "播放器单独的地址，视频直接铺满壁纸，没有周围的导航、推荐和评论。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The page is laid out at the size of the wallpaper, so `100vw` and `100vh` mean that area, and `<html>` carries `is-nifro-app` always and `nifro-is-browsing-mode` while Browsing Mode is on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "页面按壁纸的大小排版，所以 `100vw`、`100vh` 指的就是那块区域；`<html>` 上一直有 `is-nifro-app`，浏览模式开着时还有 `nifro-is-browsing-mode`。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The wallpaper comes back up on its own.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "壁纸会自己回来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This site sends Nifro to %@ every time it loads. Click to save that address instead.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个站点每次加载都会把 Nifro 送到 %@。点一下就把那个地址存下来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
